 "DixonAmplitudes"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "4a914c02-c06d-1b4c-96e6-4998be7ee1fb"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DixonReconstruct",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DixonReconstruct"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"e3159d73-b281-2a4c-822c-5191ccdedc2f"],
 ". Defines the relative amplitudes of the fat peaks being used. Can also be \
a fat model string, \"Fixed\", \"Full\", \"FitCL\", \"FitDB\", \"FitIDB\", \
\"CallCL\", \"CallDB\" or \"CallIDB\", see GenerateAmps."
}], "Usage",
